{
"file": 95,
"paths": [
"d007/d001/f287"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "9dfd74a5",
"en_raw": "What's up today?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "97ddf40e",
"en_raw": "Just a little"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "ec08cf27",
"en_raw": "I was thinking"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "84ba1786",
"en_raw": "Do you know Sunakawa of 2-2?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "f13f0d00",
"en_raw": "The class rep"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "27a6a304",
"en_raw": "I don't, but..."
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "f454d2bd",
"en_raw": "It's something I don't really want to talk about"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "c3e8d5b8",
"en_raw": "but will you listen anyway?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "567f6fc4",
"en_raw": "If I listen, will it solve your worry?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "0d9499e0",
"en_raw": "...A little, emotionally"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "7d31325a",
"en_raw": "Then I'll listen"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "9b54d523",
"en_raw": "That girl"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "f1f7ff09",
"en_raw": "attempted suicide"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "d4f61000",
"en_raw": "...She cut her own wrist"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "cb27cb81",
"en_raw": "Just before"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "117c1083",
"en_raw": "summer break started"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "e6bc0899",
"en_raw": "...Really?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "1e0a7236",
"en_raw": "I've seen Sunakawa speak up"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "430d009c",
"en_raw": "a lot at grade meetings"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "29d6a0e0",
"en_raw": "She was super serious"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "a99aae05",
"en_raw": "and hardworking"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "c01d662f",
"en_raw": "When she suggested"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "5cb695b6",
"en_raw": "making a flower bed"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "d97c3037",
"en_raw": "I thought it was"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "d97494be",
"en_raw": "maybe a bit much, but..."
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "b9786c1f",
"en_raw": "But why?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "205e4e78",
"en_raw": "Apparently bullying was the cause"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "d3e104b5",
"en_raw": "Why was she bullied?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "1ef4c0cf",
"en_raw": "I don't know the details"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "8ef993e2",
"en_raw": "and don't want to know"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "ef4c51bf",
"en_raw": "People's feelings"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "ef4c51bf",
"en_raw": "People's feelings"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "50c9515f",
"en_raw": "go this way"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "ae4eafc0",
"en_raw": "and that way"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "a11bc5d7",
"en_raw": "If you aren't careful"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "5217e397",
"en_raw": "you get swept along"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "6d361687",
"en_raw": "by the mood"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "62089cb1",
"en_raw": "and before you know it"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "b5849240",
"en_raw": "you've hurt someone"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "726d4bd1",
"en_raw": "What would you do"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "6c02ae2d",
"en_raw": "She'd probably say"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "b8c4b28c",
"en_raw": "...group psychology or something"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "029c5bc1",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi, you know"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "37749954",
"en_raw": "She seems smart"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "133c6405",
"en_raw": "I don't think so"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "e47b0695",
"en_raw": "I can't picture Sango"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "b1e72163",
"en_raw": "studying"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "c4707a43",
"en_raw": "I'm thick-skinned"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "c791a561",
"en_raw": "so I rarely feel"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "ee6461b4",
"en_raw": "hurt, but"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "c443a8fa",
"en_raw": "maybe"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "c61d68ed",
"en_raw": "I've been on the hurting side"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "a4af2df3",
"en_raw": "I was picturing everyone's"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "56bfb404",
"en_raw": "faces in class just now..."
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "56a34a8a",
"en_raw": "You're fine, Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "0e7fe1b6",
"en_raw": "...What about you, Murase?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "c690496d",
"en_raw": "Me... probably"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "922e6804",
"en_raw": "I think I'm fine, but"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "04fd9fa6",
"en_raw": "...Confident, huh"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "218d30a2",
"en_raw": "But it's pretty hard"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "66ccfebb",
"en_raw": "that kind of thing"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "30a32bc0",
"en_raw": "Sorry, Murase"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "af3dd6e9",
"en_raw": "let me worry alone a little longer"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "89e143a7",
"en_raw": "Yeah, you're right"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "09641a25",
"en_raw": "Nobody can say"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "bdea64da",
"en_raw": "that they alone"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "c9664734",
"en_raw": "are fine"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "832b0714",
"en_raw": "...But Murase, thanks for"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "893ae7f4",
"en_raw": "thinking I'm a good person"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "c5e1733a",
"en_raw": "I feel a bit saved"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "417d6f19",
"en_raw": "Don't worry too much"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "b55260c2",
"en_raw": "...Right!"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "7ccb6cdd",
"en_raw": "Well, time to go back"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "a0081489",
"en_raw": "to practice"
}
]
}